    {
      "section": "胞胎诗诀",
      "text": "绝中逢生少人知，却去当生命里推，反本还元直细辨，忽然迍否莫猜疑。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c276:p0003",
      "sha256": "e6434ca30478b21a532dbbf8791fe439e1fa65a6d3f1155885949bd5327c659a"
    },
    {
      "section": "胞胎诗诀",
      "text": "胎神一位难为绝，克陷妻奴家道劣，不惟朝暮走忙忙，羊食狼贪无以别。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c276:p0004",
      "sha256": "4cdabec686ff5f423dd48091f6742aedff09eb4a0948ef0c992347af0abd07ac"
    },
    {
      "section": "胞胎诗诀",
      "text": "眉批：胞胎者，其行如人受气於母亲腹中以至胎成而生。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
        {
